From 6478e9536c9a4371e0e73ccc6ab31fd970760c91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Chong <achong@meta.com>
Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 16:27:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rust: darwin: add panic_unwind to libstd sysroot (D79568265)

libstd only pulled libpanic_unwind.rust_sysroot for linux_musl. macOS uses
the unwind panic strategy, so the from-source darwin sysroot needs the
panic_unwind crate too; without it rustc reports E0463 (can't find crate for
panic_unwind). Add a darwin target block mirroring linux_musl.
---
 Android.bp | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 9630f12..e8c305c 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -364,6 +364,14 @@ rust_toolchain_library {
                 "libpanic_unwind.rust_sysroot",
             ],
         },
+        darwin: {
+            // macOS host uses the unwind panic strategy, so std must pull in
+            // the panic_unwind crate (built from source alongside libunwind).
+            rlibs: [
+                "libpanic_abort.rust_sysroot",
+                "libpanic_unwind.rust_sysroot",
+            ],
+        },
         android: {
             rlibs: ["libpanic_abort.rust_sysroot"],
         },
-- 
2.50.1

